Automation Factory

This script classifies packages into STANDARD, SPECIAL, or REJECTED if the size and weight are to much.

Here are the rules given:
- Bulky if package volume is greater than 1,000,000 or if any dimension is over 150 i.e (width, height, length)
- Heavy if package mass is greater than 20

REJECTED if bulky and heavy
SPECIAL if bulky or heavy
STANDARD if no criteria is met

Example outputs
STANDARD
SPECIAL
SPECIAL
REJECTED

Run script with python automation_factory.py
